   o Added checks in DEopt that vectorised functions
     return objects of correct size (will be added to PSopt
     and GAopt as well).

   o Removed NEWS.Rd (NEWS now back to plain text).


This is a very minor release. The main change is that the
package is now also available from http://enricoschumann.net

The site provides the source version and also Windows binaries
(but no Mac binaries). To install from within R, type

install.packages("NMOF", repos = "http://enricoschumann.net/R")
## or
install.packages("NMOF", repos = "http://enricoschumann.net/R",
                  type = "source")


